#. comic101 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#title.1"
msgid "\"LEAN ON ME\""
msgstr "«ОБОПРИСЬ НА МЕНЯ»"

#. comic101 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:73
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p1.1"
msgid "Radd visits Bogey's new apartment."
msgstr "Улёт навещает Бяку в его новой квартире."

#. comic101 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p1.2"
msgid "No way! Get your own place!"
msgstr "Ни за что! Ищи себе жильё сам!"

#. comic101 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:136
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p2.1"
msgid "Hey, you agreed we'd pool our money to get a swanky pad!"
msgstr "Эй, мы же договорились скинуться и снять шикарную хату!"

#. comic101 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddstand.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:140
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p2.2"
msgid "That was when I thought you'd make more than eight bucks a week."
msgstr "Это когда я думал, что ты будешь получать больше восьми баксов в неделю."

#. comic101 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddbeg.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:187
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p3.1"
msgid "Okay, so we can't split the rent fifty-fifty - but I've got nowhere to go! You gotta let me stay! <b>Please!</b>"
msgstr "Ладно, платить за квартиру пополам не выйдет - но мне некуда идти! Пусти меня пожить! <b>Пожалуйста!</b>"

#. comic101 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddbeg.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:191
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p3.2"
msgid "Oh, fine..."
msgstr "Ох, ладно…"

#. comic101 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:239
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p4.1"
msgid "Thank you, oh thank you! Which room do I get?"
msgstr "Спасибо, ой, спасибо! Какая комната моя?"

#. comic101 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddsit.gif, bogeysigh.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:243
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p4.2"
msgid "Right this way - -"
msgstr "Сюда, пожалуйста - -"

#. comic101 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: closet.gif, bogeytalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:294
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p5.1"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. comic101 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: closet.gif, bogeytalk.gif
#: kidradd/comic101.htm:296
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic101#p5.2"
msgid "I figure the broom closet is worth eight bucks."
msgstr "Думаю, шкаф для швабр как раз тянет на восемь баксов."

#. comic102 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#title.1"
msgid "\"IN AND OUT\""
msgstr "«ТУДА-СЮДА»"

#. comic102 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: closet.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p1.1"
msgid "Dude, you may've made the closet my \"room,\" but I'm not spending all day in here!"
msgstr "Чувак, пусть шкаф теперь моя «комната», но сидеть тут весь день я не собираюсь!"

#. comic102 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: closet.gif, bogeysigh2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p1.2"
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "Как угодно."

#. comic102 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p2.1"
msgid "ring! ring!"
msgstr "дзинь! дзинь!"

#. comic102 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:136
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p2.2"
msgid "<b>Ow!</b> Stupid low frame, I bumped my head."
msgstr "<b>Ай!</b> Дурацкий низкий проём!"

#. comic102 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:138
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p2.3"
msgid "You'll have to be more careful. Could you get the door please?"
msgstr "Осторожнее. Откроешь дверь?"

#. comic102 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:184
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p3.1"
msgid "Hi Radd, how are -"
msgstr "Привет, Улёт, как -"

#. comic102 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, raddright.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p3.2"
msgid "Yeah yeah, good to see ya, whatever. Excuse me."
msgstr "Да-да, рад тебя видеть, неважно. Извини."

#. comic102 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:236
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p4.1"
msgid "What's <i>he</i> so grumpy for?"
msgstr "Чего это <i>он</i> такой ворчливый?"

#. comic102 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeytalk2.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:240
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p4.2"
msgid "Oh, he just had a rough time coming out of the closet."
msgstr "А, ему просто тяжело дался выход из шкафа."

#. comic102 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif, bogeystand.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:289
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p5.1"
msgid "Wow. I really had no idea..."
msgstr "Ого. Я понятия не имела…"

#. comic102 panel p5
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif, bogeystand.gif
#: kidradd/comic102.htm:291
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic102#p5.2"
msgid "THAT'S NOT WHAT HE MEANT!"
msgstr "ОН НЕ ЭТО ИМЕЛ В ВИДУ!"

#. comic103 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#title.1"
msgid "\"YOU'RE MY BEST FRIEND\""
msgstr "«ТЫ МОЙ ЛУЧШИЙ ДРУГ»"

#. comic103 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, raddmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p1.1"
msgid "This is a nice place you guys have."
msgstr "Милое у вас тут местечко."

#. comic103 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenastand.gif, bogeysigh2.gif, raddmad.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p1.2"
msgid "<b>I</b> have."
msgstr "У <b>меня</b>."

#. comic103 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabl.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p2.1"
msgid "I know! You guys need a housewarming gift."
msgstr "Знаю! Вам нужен подарок на новоселье."

#. comic103 panel p2
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenabl.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:136
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p2.2"
msgid "Why, thank you."
msgstr "О, спасибо."

#. comic103 panel p2
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabl.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:138
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p2.3"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr "Хм?"

#. comic103 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenap.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:185
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p3.1"
msgid "How'd you like to adopt one of these cute little puzzle sprites?"
msgstr "Как насчёт того, чтобы приютить одного из этих милых спрайтиков-головоломок?"

#. comic103 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenap.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:189
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p3.2"
msgid "Uh..."
msgstr "Э-э…"

#. comic103 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:237
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p4.1"
msgid "I'm not sure I'm the type for pets."
msgstr "Я не по части питомцев."

#. comic103 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bogeystand.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:241
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p4.2"
msgid "And I don't need a pet, I've got Bogey."
msgstr "А мне питомец ни к чему, есть же Бяка."

#. comic103 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeymad.gif, raddstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:290
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p5.1"
msgid "Call me a \"pet\" again, and I'm moving your \"room\" to the clothes hamper."
msgstr "Назовёшь меня ещё раз «питомцем» — перенесу твою «комнату» в корзину для белья."

#. comic103 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeymad.gif, raddstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic103.htm:294
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic103#p5.2"
msgid "Yep, I definitely don't need more pets."
msgstr "Да, питомцев мне определённо хватает."

#. comic104 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#title.1"
msgid "\"SO VERY HAPPY\""
msgstr "«ТАКИЕ СЧАСТЛИВЫЕ»"

#. comic104 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p1.1"
msgid "Aw, come on guys, have a heart."
msgstr "Ну же, ребята, имейте сердце."

#. comic104 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p1.2"
msgid "Sigh."
msgstr "Эх."

#. comic104 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p1.3"
msgid "Er..."
msgstr "Э-э…"

#. comic104 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p2.1"
msgid "They're very easy to care for! Just set them by stuff of their color, and it sorta makes them happy. (Not nearly like their game, though...)"
msgstr "За ними очень легко ухаживать! Просто ставьте их рядом с вещами их цвета — это их вроде как радует. (Хотя до их игры, конечно, далеко…)"

#. comic104 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenap.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:184
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p3.1"
msgid "Why don't you just put a few of them on your bookshelf?"
msgstr "Может, поставите парочку на полку?"

#. comic104 panel p3
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenap.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:186
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p3.2"
msgid "A few?"
msgstr "Парочку?"

#. comic104 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenap.gif, bogeystand2.gif, raddstand2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p3.3"
msgid "Just how many of these critters are you trying to get rid of?"
msgstr "И сколько же этих зверушек ты пытаешься пристроить?"

#. comic104 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:236
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p4.1"
msgid "Oh, about 256."
msgstr "О, где-то 256."

#. comic104 panel p4
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:238
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p4.2"
msgid "Great User's Ghost!"
msgstr "Пользователь всемогущий!"

#. comic104 panel p4
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, bogeytalk2.gif, raddstare2.gif
#: kidradd/comic104.htm:240
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic104#p4.3"
msgid "Must've been a huge litter."
msgstr "Ну и выводок, должно быть, был."

#. comic105 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#title.1"
msgid "\"SUBTLETY\""
msgstr "«ДЕЛИКАТНОСТЬ»"

#. comic105 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, pred3.gif, raddstand2.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p1.1"
msgid "...So now these creatures are homeless, and it's kinda my fault."
msgstr "…В общем, эти создания теперь бездомные, и это вроде как моя вина."

#. comic105 panel p1
#. slot: middle bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, pred3.gif, raddstand2.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:79
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p1.2"
msgid "You mean totally your fault."
msgstr "В смысле, целиком твоя вина."

#. comic105 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, pred3.gif, raddstand2.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p1.3"
msgid "Radd!"
msgstr "Улёт!"

#. comic105 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p2.1"
msgid "No, he's right. And they're being kept in the Mods' RAM warehouse, where they keep the Bogey preserve, and other immobile or useless sprites. They'll never be happy there."
msgstr "Нет, он прав. Их держат в хранилище ОЗУ у Модеров, там же, где заповедник Бяк и другие неподвижные или бесполезные спрайты. Там они никогда не будут счастливы."

#. comic105 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: bhead.gif, shead.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:184
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p3.1"
msgid "Couldn't you relocate them to another copy of the same game?"
msgstr "А нельзя переселить их в другую копию той же игры?"

#. comic105 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: bhead.gif, shead.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p3.2"
msgid "I wish I could, but there's no way to get inside a game without destroying it."
msgstr "Хотела бы, но попасть внутрь игры, не уничтожив её, невозможно."

#. comic105 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:236
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p4.1"
msgid "Besides, even if I could, my bosses would probably arrest me for \"enslaving free sprites,\" or something like that."
msgstr "К тому же, даже если бы могла, начальство, наверное, арестовало бы меня за «порабощение свободных спрайтов» или что-нибудь такое."

#. comic105 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:288
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p5.1"
msgid "I think you should try anyway. Like, right now."
msgstr "По-моему, всё равно стоит попробовать. Прямо сейчас."

#. comic105 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtable.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic105.htm:292
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic105#p5.2"
msgid "How 'bout I try to jam my fist up your nose?"
msgstr "А может, я попробую засунуть кулак тебе в нос?"

#. comic106 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#title.1"
msgid "\"I DISAPPEAR\""
msgstr "«Я ИСЧЕЗАЮ»"

#. comic106 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, pred3.gif, raddstand2.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p1.1"
msgid "I guess you guys don't want any puzzle sprites, then."
msgstr "Значит, спрайты-головоломки вам не нужны."

#. comic106 panel p1
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenablink.gif, pred3.gif, raddstand2.gif, bogeymad2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:81
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p1.2"
msgid "Look, I don't see what the big deal is --"
msgstr "Слушай, не понимаю, в чём проблема --"

#. comic106 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p2.1"
msgid "They like their colors to match, right? So just leave 'em in the warehouse, but line them up by color, so they'll be happy."
msgstr "Им нравится, когда цвета совпадают, да? Так оставь их на складе, только выстрой по цветам — и они будут счастливы."

#. comic106 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatablem.gif, raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:184
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p3.1"
msgid "Are you <b>INSANE???</b> Do you want them to <b>DIE?</b>"
msgstr "Ты <b>РЕХНУЛСЯ???</b> Хочешь, чтобы они <b>УМЕРЛИ?</b>"

#. comic106 panel p3
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: sheenatablem.gif, raddtable2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:188
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p3.2"
msgid "But... You said..."
msgstr "Но… Ты же сама сказала…"

#. comic106 panel p4
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: shead.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:235
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p4.1"
msgid "Sure they love to line up, but when they do, they <b>DISAPPEAR.</b> And without their game to renew them, they'd be gone for good."
msgstr "Конечно, они обожают выстраиваться, но когда выстраиваются — они <b>ИСЧЕЗАЮТ.</b> А без игры, которая их возрождает, они исчезнут навсегда."

#. comic106 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: raddtable.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:287
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p5.1"
msgid "Oh. That would solve your problem though, wouldn't it?"
msgstr "А. Но это ведь решило бы твою проблему, разве нет?"

#. comic106 panel p5
#. slot: right bubble
#. images: raddtable.gif, sheenatablem2.gif
#: kidradd/comic106.htm:291
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic106#p5.2"
msgid "Can I use my touch of death? Please?"
msgstr "Можно я применю смертельное касание? Ну пожалуйста?"

#. comic107 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#title.1"
msgid "\"NO DOUBT\""
msgstr "«БЕЗ СОМНЕНИЙ»"

#. comic107 panel p1
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:77
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#p1.1"
msgid "Well, that was a waste. The boys didn't want any puzzle sprites."
msgstr "Ну, зря сходила. Мальчикам спрайты-головоломки не нужны."

#. comic107 panel p2
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenatable.gif
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:134
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#p2.1"
msgid "I guess I'll just hafta leave the poor guys in storage with all the other useless sprites, sigh..."
msgstr "Видно, придётся оставить бедняжек на складе со всеми прочими бесполезными спрайтами, эх…"

#. comic107 panel p3
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenabp.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:184
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#p3.1"
msgid "Well, I suppose there's one more person I can turn to for help, but..."
msgstr "Ну, есть ещё один человек, к кому можно обратиться за помощью, но…"

#. comic107 panel p5
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: sheenastare.gif, pred3.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:267
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#p5.1"
msgid "Fortunately, Sheena doesn't question her employers' hiring practices."
msgstr "К счастью, Шина не задаётся вопросами о кадровой политике своего начальства."

#. comic107 panel p5
#. slot: left bubble
#. images: sheenastare.gif, pred3.gif, closet.gif
#: kidradd/comic107.htm:273
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic107#p5.2"
msgid "I don't?"
msgstr "Разве?"

#. comic108 panel title
#. slot: background color and image
#: kidradd/comic108.htm:36
#, fuzzy
msgctxt "comic108#title.1"
msgid "\"WEIRD SCIENCE\""
msgstr "«ОХ УЖ ЭТА НАУКА!»"

#. comic108 panel p1
#. slot: narration (if any, else cut)
#. images: amp2.gif
#: kidradd/comic108.htm:73
